        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Chronic rash of hands and forearms for more than 20 years, worse over the last 3–4 months, with burning, itching, cracks and possible minor weeping. Flares with dishwashing, lemon dish liquid and strong soaps. Scratches at night and sometimes soaks in hot water."
      }
